                        <h3 class="fadeInUp animated">Paediatric and Congenital Cardiac Surgery</h3>
                        <p class="fadeInUp animated">Paediatric and Congenital Cardiac Surgery is a specialised field focussing on diagnosing and treating heart defects present since birth (congenital). These delicate surgical procedures are performed on neonates, infants, children and adolescents to repair structural abnormalities in the heart and restore healthy circulation and function.</p>
                        <p class="fadeInUp animated">At Neotia Bhagirathi Woman and Child Care Centre, New Town, our experienced paediatric cardiac surgical team is determined to provide world-class care for some of the most complex heart conditions in children offering hope and healing to families from around the every socioeconomic layers.</p>
                        <div class="mt-4">
                            <h5 class="py-3 fadeInUp animated">Conditions We Treat</h5>
                        </div>
                        <p class="pt-2 fadeInUp animated">Our team specialises in treating a wide range of congenital and acquired heart conditions, including:</p>
                        <div class="workup-sec mt-5">
                            <div class="mb-5">
                                <div class="content-001area">
                                    <div class="oo1-item fadeInUp animated">Atrial Septal Defect (ASD)</div>
                                    <div class="oo1-item fadeInUp animated">Ventricular Septal Defect (VSD)</div>
