                        <h3 class="fadeInUp animated">Cardiac Anaesthesia and Critical Care</h3>
                        <p class="fadeInUp animated">Caring for children with heart conditions requires more than just medical knowledge&mdash;it demands precision, empathy and highly specialised skills. Our Paediatric Cardiac Anaesthesia and Critical Care team is dedicated to providing safe, expert care for neonates, infants, children and adolescents undergoing cardiac surgery or interventions.</p>
                        <h3 class="fadeInUp mt-4 animated">What is Paediatric Cardiac Anaesthesia?</h3>
                        <p class="fadeInUp animated">Paediatric cardiac anaesthesia is a super-specialised field focusing on children with congenital or acquired heart diseases. From newborns with complex cardiac anomalies to older children undergoing corrective cardiac surgeries, our anaesthesiologists tailor anaesthesia plans based on age, weight, heart function and overall health.</p>
                        <p class="pt-2 fadeInUp animated">Our services include:</p>
                        <div class="workup-sec mt-5">
                            <div class="mb-5">
                                <div class="content-001area">
                                    <div class="oo1-item fadeInUp animated">Preoperative assessment and planning.</div>
                                    <div class="oo1-item fadeInUp animated">Anaesthetic management for open-heart surgeries on cardiopulmonary bypass (e.g., ASD / VSD repair, Tetralogy of Fallot correction, arterial switch operations, etc).</div>
                                    <div class="oo1-item fadeInUp animated">Sedation and anaesthesia for cardiac catheterizations, cathlab interventions and imaging (MRI / CT).</div>
                                    <div class="oo1-item fadeInUp animated">Ultrasound guided invasive lines.</div>
                                    <div class="oo1-item fadeInUp animated">Intraoperative monitoring including paediatric transesophageal echocardiography (TEE) / neonatal epicardial echocardiography.</div>
                                    <div class="oo1-item fadeInUp animated">Intraoperative Transcranial Doppler for complex cardiac surgery involving the arch of aorta to optimize cerebral protection.</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="py-3 fadeInUp animated">Paediatric Cardiac Critical Care</h4>
                            <div class="mb-4">
                                <p>Post-surgery, children are closely monitored in our Paediatric Cardiac Intensive Care Unit (PCICU), which is specially designed for the needs of young patients. Also preoperative or preprocedural optimization is done when required. Our critical care specialists are trained in managing:</p>
                            </div>
                            <ul class="listing-apps">
                                <li class="fadeInUp animated">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Neonatal and paediatric ventilatory support.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animated">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Arrhythmias and post-operative bleeding.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animated">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Cardiorespiratory and haemodynamic instability with inotropic therapy and extended cardiopulmonary bypass when needed.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animated">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Multisystem organ support for complex conditions.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animated">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Critical care point of care Ultrasonography.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
